      "evidence": "DEDR3085 explicitly gives Tamil/Malayalam tampi younger brother, with Kannada tamma and Telugu tammuḍu. These simple tampi/tambi survey responses continue the specific younger-brother kinship noun, retaining source intervocalic voicing and final vowels. The correct article is3085, not3485 (enclosure). This is a comparative family proposal; inheritance versus local transmission in this survey lect remains subject to review.",
